Rules:
  [G1] Use IAM for access control.
  [G2] Use Cloud Storage for object storage.
  [G3] Use Cloud SQL for managed databases.
  [G4] Use GKE for Kubernetes.
  [G5] Use Cloud Run for serverless containers.
  [G6] Use BigQuery for analytics.
  [G7] Use Cloud Monitoring for observability.
  [G8] Use service accounts for authentication.

